      "widgets_values": [
        "Sound cues.\n\n1. The PD Sound in the middle is inline: the images pass through it unchanged, and it plays ding when the flow reaches it (play_when: node reached).\n2. The PD Sound on its own plays chime once the whole queue has finished (a node with nothing connected always waits for the queue).\n3. If a run fails, the inline node plays the error buzzer instead (error_tone). Try it: type a file name that doesn't exist into PD Load and run.\n\nPress test sound to hear a node's sound. Sounds play in the browser tab that queued the run."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Sound cues.\n\n1. The PD Sound in the middle is inline: the images pass through it unchanged, and it plays ding when the flow reaches it (play_when: node reached).\n2. The PD Sound on its own plays chime once the whole queue has finished (a node with nothing connected always waits for the queue).\n3. If a run fails, the inline node plays the error buzzer instead (error_tone). Try it: type a file name that doesn't exist into PD Load and run.\n\nPress test sound to hear a node's sound. Sounds play in the browser tab that queued the run."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
